{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relatively simple suspense puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into four independent chapters (to be added in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is based on the four short stories of the same name in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio (Water Spraying/Corpse Transformation/Creating Animals/Testing the City God), but the content has been modified by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to collect items and solve puzzles, and solve ghosts and monsters while ensuring their own survival, and then pass the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, small puzzle games and simple puzzle games do not have particularly scary plots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter has two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the ghosts and monsters, and get the pass ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be solved by the ghosts and monsters, and get the dead ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect clearance condition is to get two endings in all chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you like it^_^</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3209560?t=1751514185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3209560?t=1751514185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209560/1081d7e65fa796e4c20ed3f628a4262c615dc740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751514185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209560/1081d7e65fa796e4c20ed3f628a4262c615dc740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751514185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relatively simple suspense puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into four independent chapters (to be added in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is based on the four short stories of the same name in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio (Water Spraying/Corpse Transformation/Creating Animals/Testing the City God), but the content has been modified by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to collect items and solve puzzles, and solve ghosts and monsters while ensuring their own survival, and then pass the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, small puzzle games and simple puzzle games do not have particularly scary plots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter has two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the ghosts and monsters, and get the pass ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be solved by the ghosts and monsters, and get the dead ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect clearance condition is to get two endings in all chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you like it^_^</p>","developers":["JiangHe"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209560/45a9138f4bbdd6b293792508930e5d847bd1e2b7/header.jpg?t=1751514185","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3209560/1023795249/7a6617bc98a777fe553bf5b2929b9ad6527f4753/1750881231/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751514183","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3209560/1023795249/7a6617bc98a777fe553bf5b2929b9ad6527f4753/1750881231/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751514183","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3209560/1023795249/7a6617bc98a777fe553bf5b2929b9ad6527f4753/1750881231/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751514183","id":257150961,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257